{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Nightshift Survival",
    "steam_appid": 2480000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/82c353361582ff2fb94071a811a8bfd3.avif?t=1740161606\" /></span>When children enter this mysterious park at midnight, there\u2019s only one option: <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightshift Survival is a challenging rogue-lite game where you will face hordes of terrifying and relentless creatures in Millennium Park. What mysteries and dangers does this place hide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3920ba6a8d45933e7f3.poster.avif?t=1740161606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3920ba6a8d45933e7f3.webm?t=1740161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3920ba6a8d45933e7f3.mp4?t=1740161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies with various movement patterns, collect powerups to survive, and unlock achievements with new items and ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/52f5519ff2f8d98d2d20da917b4cec68.webp?t=1740161606\" /></span>Be a pacifist survivor or a hunter of the mysterious creatures with the 57 items, including weapons, trinkets, and collectibles available to build your best strategy to survive the insane nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/2346c6564f48737828be95014ab28645.poster.avif?t=1740161606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/2346c6564f48737828be95014ab28645.webm?t=1740161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/2346c6564f48737828be95014ab28645.mp4?t=1740161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/7daa7e211f99d3f6c7deaef0c79b327a.webp?t=1740161606\" /></span>There are 13 sinister enemies, ranging from harmless little toys to child-devouring mechatronic beasts, all eager to play with you. Face your fears through the nights to make it unscathed until 6AM and confront the bosses of each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/845550c23cef1a21af1b3a2cff26ee87.webp?t=1740161606\" /></span>With 60 achievements, unlock new possibilities to make each playthrough unique and showcase your skills as a true collector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/366bb2554cf081f3fdc630a94b9f0572.webp?t=1740161606\" /></span>Play and replay with different combinations of items to take down enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides everything already present in the game, get ready for planned new content. Many secrets will still be revealed in the upcoming chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the night shift, if you can.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/82c353361582ff2fb94071a811a8bfd3.avif?t=1740161606\" /></span>When children enter this mysterious park at midnight, there\u2019s only one option: <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightshift Survival is a challenging rogue-lite game where you will face hordes of terrifying and relentless creatures in Millennium Park. What mysteries and dangers does this place hide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3920ba6a8d45933e7f3.poster.avif?t=1740161606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3920ba6a8d45933e7f3.webm?t=1740161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3920ba6a8d45933e7f3.mp4?t=1740161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies with various movement patterns, collect powerups to survive, and unlock achievements with new items and ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/52f5519ff2f8d98d2d20da917b4cec68.webp?t=1740161606\" /></span>Be a pacifist survivor or a hunter of the mysterious creatures with the 57 items, including weapons, trinkets, and collectibles available to build your best strategy to survive the insane nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/2346c6564f48737828be95014ab28645.poster.avif?t=1740161606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/2346c6564f48737828be95014ab28645.webm?t=1740161606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/2346c6564f48737828be95014ab28645.mp4?t=1740161606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/7daa7e211f99d3f6c7deaef0c79b327a.webp?t=1740161606\" /></span>There are 13 sinister enemies, ranging from harmless little toys to child-devouring mechatronic beasts, all eager to play with you. Face your fears through the nights to make it unscathed until 6AM and confront the bosses of each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/845550c23cef1a21af1b3a2cff26ee87.webp?t=1740161606\" /></span>With 60 achievements, unlock new possibilities to make each playthrough unique and showcase your skills as a true collector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/366bb2554cf081f3fdc630a94b9f0572.webp?t=1740161606\" /></span>Play and replay with different combinations of items to take down enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides everything already present in the game, get ready for planned new content. Many secrets will still be revealed in the upcoming chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the night shift, if you can.</strong></p>",
